WEBVTT

00:10:58.089 --> 00:11:01.976
Mund te shohesh qarte dallimin.

00:11:01.976 --> 00:11:04.505
Jane gjetje si keto

00:11:04.505 --> 00:11:07.486
qe ne besojme se mbajne te dhena

00:11:07.486 --> 00:11:11.239
se pse shohim kete dallim gjinor kaq te theksuar

00:11:11.239 --> 00:11:13.493
tek depresioni.

00:11:13.493 --> 00:11:15.051
Por edhe pse dime

00:11:15.051 --> 00:11:17.918
qe keto dallime ekzistojne,

00:11:17.918 --> 00:11:20.571
66 perqind

00:11:20.571 --> 00:11:24.567
e kerkimit ne tru qe fillon tek kafshet

00:11:24.567 --> 00:11:26.893
behet ose ne kafshe meshkuj

00:11:26.893 --> 00:11:31.240
ose ne kafshe me gjini te paidentifikuar.